  "board table": "typed into tools/regrade.py's GAZETTEER by an earlier research session, with no source recorded for any value. They are not from a cited gazetteer. Replacing them with a cited one (GeoNames or Natural Earth), and the plain grid with a cited basemap, is a phase R item."
 },
